From: Yong-Q <yong-q@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:14:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] maceles: complete LES integration with charge-response forces

- les_ewald.hpp: periodic triclinic GTO-Ewald with analytic forces,
  dE/dq, host reference and finite-difference self-test
- LES charge readouts (linear H1 + MLP H2) in the Kokkos MACE path,
  with charge finalization and model-provided les_norm_factor
- apply_les_charge_adjoint(): backpropagates dE_LR/dq through both
  charge readouts into H1_adj/H2_adj (the missing force term)
- pair_symmetrix_mace_kokkos: LAMMPS box/positions plumbing, Ewald
  force merge, charge debug dump
- symmetrix/extract_maceles.py: checkpoint export with the compact
  engine fusion basis, e3nn path normalization, model norm factor
